      "raw": "<p>Hi All.&nbsp; I&#39;m sorry if this has already been answered elsewhere, but I couldn&#39;t find the answer.&nbsp; In the unlock threads people post a lot of game logs.&nbsp; Where are those located?&nbsp; Is it a steam thing?&nbsp; Thanks!</p>",
