    {
      "id": 208177,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-11-07T01:29:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s mostly Steam. &nbsp;I think you might be able to find it on Android but I’m not sure. Anyways, this was posted on Steam forums on how to gather them:</p>\n<div>\n[quote=\"Deej-O-Matic\"]\n</div><ul>\n<li>I saw this asked in a thread. &nbsp;Rather than have new users need to dig through threads for it, I figured it'd be easier to just have a thread dedicated on how to do it. &nbsp;I only know how to do it on Windows, so if anyone would like to post a tutorial on other OSs, I'll gladly update this.</li>\n<li> Your log can be found by punching in \"C:\\Users\\(YourNameHere)\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Handelabra Games Inc_\\Sentinels\" to your File Explorer. &nbsp;At the bottom there will be a text file called \"log\" and another called \"multiplayer_log.\" &nbsp;Open it then copy the whole thing. </li>\n<li> Go to pastebin.com and paste your gamelog, then click \"Create new paste.\" &nbsp;Once it's done, just copy the url url for the paste and post it where you need. </li>\n<li> Here's a practical example. &nbsp;I wanted to have a short log, so I fought Iron Legacy as 5 of the Freedom Six at Wagner Mars Base. &nbsp;Here's the log: &nbsp;http://pastebin.com/rUH5KU07 </li>\n<li> Let's say I want to find out which round F6 Tachyon was incapped. &nbsp;I do a search for \"Iron Legacy's Start\" to narrow down when each round starts. &nbsp;His third turn is line 277. &nbsp;So I scroll down from there until I find \"Tachyon was flipped\" (345). &nbsp;And yes you don't need to tell me that getting rid of Meteor Storm was a terrible idea. &nbsp;I said I wanted a short log. </li>\n<li> The game only saves two logs and that's the last game you played solo and the last one you played over multiplayer. &nbsp;The biggest benefit is for the discussion of variant unlocking; but don't forget that these can also be sent with bug reports for Handlabra to help track down the exact causes of bugs. </li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/quote]</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:38:01.582Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
