      "raw": "It&rsquo;s mostly Steam. &nbsp;I think you might be able to find it on Android but I&rsquo;m not sure. Anyways, this was posted on Steam forums on how to gather them:\n<div>\n[quote=\"Deej-O-Matic\"]\n</div><ul><li>I saw this asked in a thread. &nbsp;Rather than have new users need to dig through threads for it, I figured it&#39;d be easier to just have a thread dedicated on how to do it. &nbsp;I only know how to do it on Windows, so if anyone would like to post a tutorial on other OSs, I&#39;ll gladly update this.</li><li> Your log can be found by punching in &quot;C:\\Users\\(YourNameHere)\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Handelabra Games Inc_\\Sentinels&quot; to your File Explorer. &nbsp;At the bottom there will be a text file called &quot;log&quot; and another called &quot;multiplayer_log.&quot; &nbsp;Open it then copy the whole thing. </li><li> Go to pastebin.com and paste your gamelog, then click &quot;Create new paste.&quot; &nbsp;Once it&#39;s done, just copy the url url for the paste and post it where you need. </li><li> Here&#39;s a practical example. &nbsp;I wanted to have a short log, so I fought Iron Legacy as 5 of the Freedom Six at Wagner Mars Base. &nbsp;Here&#39;s the log: &nbsp;http://pastebin.com/rUH5KU07 </li><li> Let&#39;s say I want to find out which round F6 Tachyon was incapped. &nbsp;I do a search for &quot;Iron Legacy&#39;s Start&quot; to narrow down when each round starts. &nbsp;His third turn is line 277. &nbsp;So I scroll down from there until I find &quot;Tachyon was flipped&quot; (345). &nbsp;And yes you don&#39;t need to tell me that getting rid of Meteor Storm was a terrible idea. &nbsp;I said I wanted a short log. </li><li> The game only saves two logs and that&#39;s the last game you played solo and the last one you played over multiplayer. &nbsp;The biggest benefit is for the discussion of variant unlocking; but don&#39;t forget that these can also be sent with bug reports for Handlabra to help track down the exact causes of bugs. </li></ul>\n \n[/quote]\n \n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
