      "created_at": "2017-11-07T01:31:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Steam logs are in:&nbsp;C:\\Users\\(username)\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Handelabra Games Inc_\\Sentinels</p><p>Android logs are in: [internal storage] &gt; Android &gt; data &gt; com.Handelabra.Sentinels &gt; files</p><p>I have no idea about iOS.</p>",
